{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/matrices-determinants/determinants/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/matrices-determinants/determinants.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Determinants | Mathematics","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/matrices-determinants/\" class=\"text-blue-600\">← Back to Matrices &amp; Determinants</a></nav>\n    <article class=\"content-card rounded-lg p-6\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Determinants</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Determinant of 2×2 and 3×3 matrices, properties of determinants and using determinants to check invertibility.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Worked example</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700\">det([[a,b],[c,d]]) = ad - bc. For [[1,2],[3,4]] = 1·4 - 2·3 = -2.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Practice</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Find determinant of [[2,1],[1,2]].</li>\n        <li>Is [[1,2],[3,4]] invertible? (brief check).</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Brief solutions</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700\">\n        <li>det = 4 - 1 = 3.</li>\n        <li>det = -2 ≠ 0 so invertible.\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-sky-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.content-card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}